#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "84_Businessman"
msgid "See this spot over here? I heard it's like a local hub\\r\nfor foreigners."
msgstr "¿Ves este lugar? Dicen que es para extranjeros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "96_Businessman's Girlfriend"
msgid "Foreigners? Really? Like those guys from the\\r\nmovies? Big Hollywood stars?"
msgstr "¿Extranjeros? ¿En serio? ¿Actores de Hollywood\no algo así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "108_Businessman"
msgid "Nope, think a little more... eastward. I'm talking\\r\nimmigrants from other Asian countries."
msgstr "Nop, es más para inmigrantes asiáticos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "120_Businessman's Girlfriend"
msgid "Oh, wow... I bet I'd walk in the room and have no idea\\r\nwhat anybody's saying."
msgstr "Ah pues mira. Apuesto a que entro y no tendré ni idea\nde lo que están hablando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "132_Businessman"
msgid "Yeah, but I'm sure you'd understand their cooking.\\r\nGood food's like an international language. I'd love\\r\nto try this place out, but I don't know how to get in."
msgstr "Pero seguro que le entenderas a su comida.\nLa cocina es el mejor idioma y me gustaría probar la\nde este lugar, pero no sé como entrar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "144_Businessman's Girlfriend"
msgid "Can't you enter from where that guy's always standing?\\r\nWonder why he's not there now..."
msgstr "¿Y no puedes entrar dónde está el tipo ese parado?\nAhora que me fijo, ya no está..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "156_Businessman"
msgid "Hey, you're right. Still, you don't know what to expect\\r\naround here. I bet no one even speaks Japanese."
msgstr "Es cierto. Bueno, no sé que podría esperar de este lugar.\nApuesto a que nadie habla japonés."
